# Autowrap at the right margin (DECAWM, on by default).
# A glyph printed at the last column sets a pending wrap; the *next* glyph
# moves to column 0 of the following row.
size: 10x3
description: printing past the right margin wraps to the next row

--- input
abcdefghijk

--- expect-grid
|abcdefghij|
|k|
||

--- expect-cursor
row=1 col=1
